{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "title": "Pilot plat 100 x 80 x 10 mm, 4 lubang M6 counterbore",
  "intent": "Pilot native menuju gerbang v0.1. Balok berdimensi lalu empat lubang counterbore pada permukaan ATAS - bukan Front Plane, karena di sana koordinat sketsa kebetulan sama dengan koordinat model sehingga transformasi yang hilang pun akan lulus.",
  "units": {
    "length": "mm",
    "angle": "deg"
  },
  "parameters": {
    "width": {
      "value": 100,
      "unit": "mm",
      "source": "user_stated"
    },
    "height": {
      "value": 80,
      "unit": "mm",
      "source": "user_stated"
    },
    "depth": {
      "value": 10,
      "unit": "mm",
      "source": "user_stated"
    }
  },
  "document": {
    "type": "part",
    "template": null,
    "savePath": null
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "tool": "create_sketch",
      "arguments": {
        "plane": {
          "kind": "plane",
          "by": "name",
          "name": "Front Plane"
        },
        "name": "BlockProfile"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "tool": "add_rectangle",
      "dependsOn": [
        "s1"
      ],
      "arguments": {
        "mode": "corner",
        "corner": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        },
        "width": "$width",
        "height": "$height",
        "addDimensions": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "tool": "close_sketch",
      "dependsOn": [
        "s2"
      ],
      "arguments": {
        "sketchName": "BlockProfile"
      },
      "expect": {
        "sketchFullyDefined": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "tool": "extrude_boss",
      "dependsOn": [
        "s3"
      ],
      "arguments": {
        "sketch": {
          "kind": "sketch",
          "by": "name",
          "name": "BlockProfile"
        },
        "endCondition": {
          "type": "blind",
          "depth": "$depth"
        },
        "direction": "normal",
        "merge": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "volumeIncreases": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "tool": "hole_wizard",
      "dependsOn": [
        "s4"
      ],
      "arguments": {
        "holeType": "counterbore",
        "standard": "ISO",
        "fastenerSize": "M6",
        "positions": [
          {
            "x": 20,
            "y": 20,
            "z": 10
          },
          {
            "x": 80,
            "y": 20,
            "z": 10
          },
          {
            "x": 20,
            "y": 60,
            "z": 10
          },
          {
            "x": 80,
            "y": 60,
            "z": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "volumeDecreases": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    {
      "id": "rebuild",
      "check": "rebuild_clean",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "id": "constraints",
      "check": "all_sketches_fully_defined",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "id": "volume",
      "check": "nonzero_volume",
      "required": true
    }
  ],
  "openQuestions": [],
  "risks": [
    "Posisi dalam KOORDINAT MODEL. Balok menempati x 0..100, y 0..80, z 0..10, jadi z=10 adalah permukaan atas. Empat lubang berjarak 20 mm dari tiap tepi.",
    "Volume akhir TIDAK dipatok angkanya: diameter counterbore ISO M6 ditentukan basis data Hole Wizard, bukan oleh kami. Hanya arah perubahannya yang dipatok.",
    "Jalur feature-definition untuk Hole Wizard belum pernah dijalankan. Setiap asumsinya dibungkus Require yang MENYEBUT asumsinya, supaya run pertama memberi tahu mana yang salah alih-alih menghasilkan lubang yang keliru.",
    "Berbeda dari examples/mounting-plate.plan.json, yang merupakan contoh acuan Fase 3 untuk executor palsu dan memakai Top Plane, rectangle center, serta fillet. Berkas ini pilot native dan sengaja lebih sempit."
  ],
  "provenance": {
    "generatedBy": "native golden pilot",
    "editedByHuman": true
  }
}
